@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

# Canonical requests — same URLs as docs/{pl,en,de}/labs/ and the HTML deck.
# Hot customer used in workshops 2–4: CustomerId 123 / name "Customer 123".

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### LAB01 — From HTTP Request to SQL Server
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop1/customers-bad

### LAB03 — projection (use after measuring customers-bad)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop1/customers-good

### LAB02 — deferred execution (composition only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop1/deferred/City%201

### LAB02 — extra predicate before materialization
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop1/deferred/City%201?minId=1000

### LAB04 / LAB05 — missing index, then covering index
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop2/orders/customer/123

### LAB05 — covering-friendly projection
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop2/orders/customer/123/projection

### LAB06 — non-SARGable search
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop2/customers/search-bad/Customer%20123

### LAB06 — SARGable search
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop2/customers/search-good/Customer%20123

### LAB07 — blocking holder (30s transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/blocking/1

### LAB07 — blocked updater (run while blocking is in flight)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/update/1?status=Completed

### LAB08 — hold uncommitted update (30s then rollback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/isolation/hold/10

### LAB08 — READ COMMITTED (run while hold is in flight)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/isolation/read-committed/10

### LAB08 — READ UNCOMMITTED (run while hold is in flight)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/isolation/read-uncommitted/10

### LAB09 — deadlock session A (Customers then Orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/deadlock/session-a?customerId=1&orderId=1

### LAB09 — deadlock session B (Orders then Customers) — start together with A
POST {{baseUrl}}/workshop3/deadlock/session-b?customerId=1&orderId=1

### LAB11 — incident (hot customer over-fetch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop4/customer/123/orders-bad

### LAB10 / LAB11 — N+1 (50 extra round-trips)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop4/customer/123/orders-nplus1

### LAB11 — improved projection (hidden from Swagger; use after diagnosis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workshop4/customer/123/orders-good
